The '''Musk family''' is a prominent family with roots in [[South Africa]], [[Canada]], [[England]], and the [[United States]], whose most famous member is billionaire [[Elon Musk]]. It also includes his parents [[Maye Musk]], a model and author, and [[Errol Musk]], a mine-owner, businessman and politician; siblings [[Kimbal Musk]] and [[Tosca Musk]], and cousin [[Lyndon Rive]]. Elon Musk's ex-wives are [[Justine Musk]] and [[Talulah Riley]], and he has many children, including [[Vivian Wilson]]. Maye's father [[Joshua N. Haldeman]] was a notable [[Chiropractic|chiropractor]], aviator, and politician who promoted [[technocracy]] and [[South African apartheid]].

==Elon Musk==
{{Elon Musk series|expanded=Personal}}
{{Excerpt|Elon Musk}}

=== Relationships and children ===
According to ''[[The Wall Street Journal]]'', Musk has fathered at least fourteen children, one of whom is deceased; the sources close to Musk suggest that the "true number of Musk's children is much higher than publicly known".<ref name="Mattioli 16APR2025">{{cite web|url=https://www.wsj.com/politics/elon-musk-children-mothers-ashley-st-clair-grimes-dc7ba05c|title=The Tactics Elon Musk Uses to Manage His ‘Legion’ of Babies—and Their Mothers|publisher=The Wall Street Journal|last=Mattioli|first=Dana|date=16 April 2025|access-date=16 April 2025|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Bouris |first=Catherine |date=February 14, 2025 |title=Right-Wing Influencer: Elon Musk Is the Father of My 5-Month-Old |url=https://www.thedailybeast.com/right-wing-influencer-elon-musk-is-the-father-of-my-5-month-old/ |access-date=February 14, 2025 |website=[[The Daily Beast]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Murray |first=Conor |title=Elon Musk Still Hasn't Commented As Right-Wing Influencer Claims She Had His 13th Child |url=https://www.forbes.com/sites/conormurray/2025/02/15/elon-musk-still-hasnt-commented-as-right-wing-influencer-claims-she-had-his-13th-child/ |access-date=2025-02-19 |website=Forbes |language=en}}</ref><ref name=":0">{{Cite web |title=Elon Musk Welcomes 14th Child, His Fourth Baby with Shivon Zilis |url=https://people.com/elon-musk-welcomes-14th-child-with-shivon-zilis-11688958 |access-date=2025-03-01 |website=People.com |language=en}}</ref> He met his first wife, Canadian author [[Justine Wilson]], while attending Queen's University in Ontario, Canada; they married in 2000.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Durand Streisand |first=Elizabeth |title=A Look at Elon Musk's Rocky Romantic History |url=https://www.yahoo.com/celebrity/blogs/celeb-news/elon-musk-love-life-romantic-history-171340935.html |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200602025744/https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/blogs/celeb-news/elon-musk-love-life-romantic-history-171340935.html |archive-date=June 2, 2020 |access-date=May 29, 2017 |work=Yahoo}}</ref> In 2002, their first child Nevada Musk died of [[sudden infant death syndrome]] at the age of 10 weeks.{{sfn|Vance|2017|p=117}} After his death, the couple used [[In vitro fertilisation|in vitro fertilization]] (IVF) to continue their family;<ref name="Crowley-2021">{{Cite news |last=Crowley |first=James |date=September 14, 2021 |title=Elon Musk's Kids: Meet His 6 Kids From Oldest To Youngest, & Their Moms |url=https://hollywoodlife.com/feature/elon-musk-kids-4516506/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210916014406/https://hollywoodlife.com/feature/elon-musk-kids-4516506/ |archive-date=September 16, 2021 |access-date=September 16, 2021 |work=Hollywood Life}}</ref> they had twins in 2004, followed by triplets in 2006.<ref name="Crowley-2021" /> The couple divorced in 2008 and had [[Joint custody (United States)|shared custody]] of their children.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Musk |first=Justine |date=September 10, 2010 |title="I Was a Starter Wife": Inside America's Messiest Divorce |url=https://www.marieclaire.com/sex-love/a5380/millionaire-starter-wife/ |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200730172806/https://www.marieclaire.com/sex-love/a5380/millionaire-starter-wife/ |archive-date=July 30, 2020 |access-date=September 3, 2020 |work=Marie Claire}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |date=April 27, 2015 |title=Elon Musk's Ex-Wife on What It Takes to Be a Mogul |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2015/04/28/business/dealbook/insider-offers-a-view-from-moguls-lofty-heights.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220626164639/https://www.nytimes.com/2015/04/28/business/dealbook/insider-offers-a-view-from-moguls-lofty-heights.html |archive-date=June 26, 2022 |access-date=June 26, 2022 |work=The New York Times}}</ref>

In 2008, Musk began dating English actress [[Talulah Riley]].{{sfn|Vance|2017|pp=193–195}} They married two years later at [[Dornoch Cathedral]] in Scotland.<ref>{{Cite news |date=March 21, 2016 |title=Actor Talulah Riley files to divorce billionaire Elon Musk, again |url=https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2016/mar/21/elon-musk-talulah-riley-file-divorce-second-marriage |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180616231332/https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2016/mar/21/elon-musk-talulah-riley-file-divorce-second-marriage |archive-date=June 16, 2018 |access-date=April 20, 2016 |work=The Guardian |agency=Associated Press}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Boyle |first=Alan |date=January 18, 2012 |title=SpaceX's millionaire founder tweets about marital split |url=https://www.nbcnews.com/science/spacexs-millionaire-founder-tweets-about-marital-split-6C10402497 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220701212028/https://www.nbcnews.com/science/spacexs-millionaire-founder-tweets-about-marital-split-6C10402497 |archive-date=July 1, 2022 |access-date=September 28, 2013 |publisher=NBC News}}</ref> In 2012, the couple divorced, before remarrying the following year.<ref name="The Daily Telegraph-2016" /> After briefly filing for divorce in 2014,<ref name="The Daily Telegraph-2016">{{Cite news |date=October 22, 2016 |title=Elon Musk and Talulah Riley divorce for a second time |url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/news/2016/10/22/elon-musk-and-talulah-riley-divorce-for-a-second-time/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180630004337/https://www.telegraph.co.uk/news/2016/10/22/elon-musk-and-talulah-riley-divorce-for-a-second-time/ |archive-date=June 30, 2018 |access-date=June 29, 2018 |work=The Daily Telegraph}}</ref> Musk finalized a second divorce from Riley in 2016.{{sfn|Vance|2017|p=372}} Musk then dated [[Amber Heard]] for several months in 2017;<ref>{{Cite news |last=Jensen |first=Erin |date=April 24, 2017 |title=Amber Heard, Elon Musk make 'Cheeky' public debut together |url=https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2017/04/24/amber-heard-elon-musk-dating-public-debut-instagram-posts/100834568/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210130231024/https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2017/04/24/amber-heard-elon-musk-dating-public-debut-instagram-posts/100834568/ |archive-date=January 30, 2021 |access-date=January 28, 2021 |work=USA Today}}</ref> he had reportedly been "pursuing" her since 2012.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Sigel |first=Tatiana |date=December 6, 2018 |title=Amber Heard on Her Secret Passion, Elon Musk and a Splashy New Role |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/features/amber-heard-aquaman-elon-musk-dedication-activism-1166004 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20181206185106/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/features/amber-heard-aquaman-elon-musk-dedication-activism-1166004 |archive-date=December 6, 2018 |access-date=January 28, 2021 |work=The Hollywood Reporter}}</ref>

In 2018, Musk and Canadian musician [[Grimes]] said that they were dating.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Darville |first=Jordan |date=March 20, 2019 |title=Grimes talks new music, Elon Musk, plans to publicly execute her musical persona |url=https://www.thefader.com/2019/03/20/grimes-interview-miss-anthropocene |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20191030070534/http://www.thefader.com/2019/03/20/grimes-interview-miss-anthropocene |archive-date=October 30, 2019 |access-date=December 13, 2020 |work=The Fader}}</ref> Grimes gave birth to Musk's seventh child in May 2020.<ref name="Kiefer-2020">{{Cite news |last=Kiefer |first=Halle |date=May 4, 2020 |title=Grimes and Elon Musk's Baby Has Arrived, Just As Legend Foretold |url=https://www.vulture.com/2020/05/elon-musk-and-grimes-welcome-first-baby-together.html |url-access=limited |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200505021026/https://www.vulture.com/2020/05/elon-musk-and-grimes-welcome-first-baby-together.html |archive-date=May 5, 2020 |access-date=May 5, 2020 |work=Vulture}}</ref><ref name="Trepany-2020">{{Cite news |last=Trepany |first=Charles |date=May 5, 2020 |title=Elon Musk shares first photo of his and Grimes' new baby boy: 'Mom and baby all good' |url=https://eu.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2020/05/05/elon-musk-grimes-welcome-baby/3082615001/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200529124947/https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2020/05/05/elon-musk-grimes-welcome-baby/3082615001/ |archive-date=May 29, 2020 |access-date=May 5, 2020 |work=USA Today}}</ref> In December 2021, Grimes and Musk had a second child together (Musk's tenth child), born via [[surrogacy]].<ref name="Gordon-2022">{{Cite magazine |last=Gordon |first=Devin |date=March 10, 2022 |title="Infamy Is Kind Of Fun": Grimes on Music, Mars, and—Surprise!—Her Secret New Baby With Elon Musk |url=https://www.vanityfair.com/style/2022/03/grimes-cover-story-on-music-and-mars |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220521235459/https://www.vanityfair.com/style/2022/03/grimes-cover-story-on-music-and-mars |archive-date=May 21, 2022 |access-date=March 10, 2022 |magazine=Vanity Fair}}</ref> Despite the pregnancy, Musk confirmed reports that the couple were "semi-separated" in September 2021; in an interview with [[Time (magazine)|''Time'']] in December 2021, he said he was single.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Ivie |first=Devon |date=September 24, 2021 |title=Elon Musk and Grimes Took the Red Pill and Broke Up |url=https://www.vulture.com/2021/09/elon-musk-and-grimes-break-up-after-3-years-together.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210924171854/https://www.vulture.com/2021/09/elon-musk-and-grimes-break-up-after-3-years-together.html |archive-date=September 24, 2021 |access-date=September 28, 2021 |work=Vulture}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |date=September 24, 2021 |title=Elon Musk says he and partner Grimes are semi-separated |url=https://www.bbc.com/news/world-us-canada-58684724 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210928064543/https://www.bbc.com/news/world-us-canada-58684724 |archive-date=September 28, 2021 |access-date=September 28, 2021 |publisher=BBC News}}</ref> In March 2022, Grimes said of her relationship with Musk: "I would probably refer to him as my boyfriend, but we're very fluid."<ref name="Gordon-2022" /> Later that month, Grimes tweeted that she and Musk had broken up again.<ref>{{Cite news |last=D'Zurill |first=Christie |date=March 11, 2022 |title=Never mind that new baby: Grimes and Elon Musk have broken up again, she says |url=https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/music/story/2022-03-11/grimes-elon-musk-relationship-breakup-split |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220525052031/https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/music/story/2022-03-11/grimes-elon-musk-relationship-breakup-split |archive-date=May 25, 2022 |access-date=March 14, 2022 |work=Los Angeles Times}}</ref> In September 2023 it was reported that the pair had had a third child (Musk's eleventh).<ref>{{Cite news |last=Szalai |first=Jennifer |date=September 9, 2023 |title=Elon Musk Wants to Save Humanity. The Only Problem: People. |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2023/09/09/books/review/elon-musk-walter-isaacson.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20230909163003/https://www.nytimes.com/2023/09/09/books/review/elon-musk-walter-isaacson.html |archive-date=September 9, 2023 |access-date=September 19, 2023 |work=The New York Times}}</ref> In October 2023, Grimes sued Musk over parental rights and custody of their eldest.<ref>{{Cite web |date=November 11, 2023 |title=Grimes Says Elon Musk Evaded Being Served With Child Custody Papers At Least 12 Times |url=https://www.huffpost.com/entry/grimes-says-elon-musk-evaded-being-served-with-child-custody-papers-at-least-12-times_n_654f920ce4b0c9f24660475c |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240217191409/https://www.huffpost.com/entry/grimes-says-elon-musk-evaded-being-served-with-child-custody-papers-at-least-12-times_n_654f920ce4b0c9f24660475c |archive-date=February 17, 2024 |access-date=April 21, 2024 |publisher=HuffPost}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=December 7, 2023 |title=Elon Musk Drags Grimes' Tweets Into Increasingly Nasty Custody Battle |url=https://futurism.com/the-byte/elon-musk-grimes-tweets-custody |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231216111458/https://futurism.com/the-byte/elon-musk-grimes-tweets-custody |archive-date=December 16, 2023 |access-date=April 21, 2024 |publisher=Futurism}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Musk Sued By Ex-Girlfriend Grimes Over Parental Rights: Report |url=https://www.ndtv.com/feature/elon-musk-sued-by-ex-girlfriend-grimes-over-parental-rights-report-4447991 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240311001659/https://www.ndtv.com/feature/elon-musk-sued-by-ex-girlfriend-grimes-over-parental-rights-report-4447991 |archive-date=March 11, 2024 |access-date=April 21, 2024 |publisher=NDTV}}</ref>

In July 2022, ''Insider'' published court documents revealing that Musk had had his eighth and ninth children, twins born via [[In vitro fertilisation|IVF]] with [[Shivon Zilis]], director of operations and special projects at [[Neuralink]], in November 2021.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Ankel |first=Sophia |date=August 27, 2022 |title=Elon Musk and Neuralink exec had twins via IVF, no romance: report |url=https://www.businessinsider.com/elon-musk-neuralink-exec-twins-via-ivf-no-romance-report-2022-8 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240709140834/https://www.businessinsider.com/elon-musk-neuralink-exec-twins-via-ivf-no-romance-report-2022-8 |archive-date=July 9, 2024 |access-date=July 9, 2024 |website=Business Insider |language=en-US}}</ref> They were born weeks before Musk and Grimes had their second child via surrogacy in December. The news "raise[d] questions about workplace ethics", given that Zilis directly reported to Musk.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Safronova |first=Valeriya |date=July 7, 2022 |title=How Many Children Does Elon Musk Have? |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2022/07/07/style/elon-musk-children.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221023160331/https://www.nytimes.com/2022/07/07/style/elon-musk-children.html |archive-date=October 23, 2022 |access-date=July 8, 2022 |work=The New York Times}}</ref> Zilis's third child together with Musk (his twelfth child) was born in early 2024 via surrogacy.<ref>{{Cite web |date=June 24, 2024 |title=Who Is Shivon Zilis? Meet the Mother of 3 of Elon Musk's 12 Children |url=https://www.eonline.com/news/1404242/who-is-shivon-zilis-meet-the-mother-of-3-of-elon-musks-12-children |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240709140834/https://www.eonline.com/news/1404242/who-is-shivon-zilis-meet-the-mother-of-3-of-elon-musks-12-children |archive-date=July 9, 2024 |access-date=July 9, 2024 |website=E! Online}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Alexander |first=Sophie |last2=Hull |first2=Dana |date=June 21, 2024 |title=Elon Wants YOU to Have More Babies |url=https://www.bloomberg.com/features/2024-elon-musk-population-collapse-baby-push/ |access-date=June 21, 2024 |publisher=[[Bloomberg News]]}}</ref> His fourth child with Zilis was born in 2025.<ref name=":0" />

On February 14, 2025, Ashley St. Clair, an influencer and author, posted on X claiming to have given birth to Musk's son Romulus five months earlier, which media outlets reported as Musk's supposed thirteenth child.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Snider |first=Mike |title=Ashley St. Clair says Elon Musk is the father of baby she had in 2024 |url=https://www.usatoday.com/story/tech/news/2025/02/17/elon-musk-ashley-st-clair-children-kids/78744733007/ |access-date=2025-02-19 |website=USA TODAY |language=en-US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=2025-02-18 |title=Elon Musk breaks silence after MAGA influencer claims he's fathered 13th child |url=https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/americas/us-politics/elon-musk-response-ashley-st-clair-baby-b2699865.html |access-date=2025-02-19 |website=The Independent |language=en}}</ref>

== Vivian Wilson ==
{{Main|Vivian Wilson}}
[[File:Vivian Jenna Wilson - February 2025.jpg|thumb|Vivian Wilson in February 2025]]
Vivian Jenna Wilson <!--quote: "The book also calls her by her middle name, Jenna."--> (born April 15, 2004)<ref name="NBC">{{Cite web |last=Ingram |first=David |date=July 26, 2024 |title=Elon Musk's transgender daughter, in first interview, says he berated her for being queer as a child |url=https://www.nbcnews.com/tech/tech-news/elon-musk-transgender-daughter-vivian-wilson-interview-rcna163665 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240727212441/https://www.nbcnews.com/tech/tech-news/elon-musk-transgender-daughter-vivian-wilson-interview-rcna163665 |archive-date=July 27, 2024 |access-date=March 24, 2025 |publisher=[[NBC]] |language=en}}</ref> is an American social media personality and member of the Musk family. The eldest daughter of [[Elon Musk|Elon]] and [[Justine Musk]], Wilson [[gender identity|came out]] as a [[transgender woman]] in 2020, and was featured in ''[[Teen Vogue]]'' in 2025. As of March 2025, she is studying in [[Tokyo]].

